---
name: Palomaesque
ingredients:
  - type: Mezcal
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Honey
    amount: 1 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Cocchi Americano
    amount: 1 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Grapefruit juice
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lime juice
    amount: 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Seltzer water
    amount: 1 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Salt
    amount: '1'
    unit: pinch
    garnish: false
  - type: Grapefruit
    amount: 1/2
    unit: wheel
    garnish: true
category:
  - tequila
image: ../../images/cocktails/palomaesque/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.foodandwine.com/recipes/palomaesque-cocktail
---
1. In a cocktail shaker, stir the mezcal with the honey until dissolved.
1. Add the Cocchi Americano, grapefruit juice, lime juice and salt. Fill the shaker with ice and shake until well chilled.
1. Fill a large glass with ice and add the seltzer and grapefruit wheel. Strain the cocktail into the glass and serve.
